Build Pixy for an independently signed arm64 iOS Simulator app.
Use the upstream Bun lock graph with Sentry and unrelated development tools removed.
Package-manager constraints: https://github.com/mrzmyr/pixy-mood-tracker-app/pull/1137
Apple Health integration: https://github.com/mrzmyr/pixy-mood-tracker-app/pull/652
Enable Expo's SDK 57 scene lifecycle for iOS 27. https://github.com/expo/expo/issues/46664

